Additional Use Grant:

You may use the Licensed Work for development, testing, evaluation,
and production use, including use for the internal business purposes
of an individual or organization.

You may install, operate, modify, and use the Licensed Work on
infrastructure owned, leased, or controlled by you, including
infrastructure provided by a public or private cloud provider.

You may also engage a third party to install, maintain, support, or
operate the Licensed Work on your behalf, provided that the Licensed
Work is used solely for your internal business purposes.

You may not use the Licensed Work to provide a Hosted Kairo Service
to third parties without a separate commercial license from the
Licensor.

For purposes of this Additional Use Grant, a "Hosted Kairo Service"
means a service in which:

(a) the Licensed Work is operated by or on behalf of the service
    provider;

(b) third-party customers are provided access to the functionality
    of the Licensed Work as a hosted, managed, cloud, SaaS, or
    similar service; and

(c) providing such functionality is offered as a product or service
    to those third-party customers.

For clarity, the following are permitted and do not constitute a
Hosted Kairo Service:

- using the Licensed Work to operate your own applications, products,
  services, infrastructure, or business;

- using the Licensed Work to deliver events from your applications
  to your own customers, partners, or external systems;

- allowing your customers to configure destinations, subscriptions,
  endpoints, or delivery preferences as part of your own product;

- providing consulting, installation, integration, maintenance,
  hosting, or operational services for a specific customer where
  the Licensed Work is used solely for that customer's internal
  business purposes;

- building applications or services that use the Licensed Work as
  an internal infrastructure component, provided that customers are
  not being offered the Licensed Work itself as a hosted or managed
  service.

A separate commercial license is required to offer a Hosted Kairo
Service.

